# Production builds require ONE of the following two settings
# (`bun run build` fails otherwise):

# 1) External intake endpoint for the /demo form (API Gateway/Lambda,
#    Formspree, etc.). The static export has no server, so submissions
#    must POST here. Preferred once the email workspace / intake is live.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# 2) Interim, explicit email-draft mode: the form visibly tells visitors
#    that submitting opens a pre-filled email draft to contact@squarecampus.com.
#    Use only until the intake endpoint exists, then remove.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_MODE=email

# Optional: override the canonical base URL for preview deployments.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://squarecampus.com
